{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32538","headline":"寄远 · 刘驾","name":"寄远","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪花岂结子，徒满连理枝。\n嫁作征人妻，不得长相随。\n去年君点行，贱妾是新姬。\n别早见未熟，入梦无定姿。\n悄悄空闺中，蛩声遶罗帏。\n得书喜犹甚，况复见君时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}